    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miniwars</strong> is a digital turn-based strategy board game where you compete against players or AI in a tactical battle for territory. Choose your starting position on the map, then use unique unit types to fight for resources, expand your land, and outmaneuver your opponents. Whether you\u2019re planning, building, or battling, your objective is to secure the most territory by the end of the game or be the last player standing. Prepare to fight and strategize your way to victory in <i>Miniwars</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This page is a work-in-progress. Expect updates and more details as we get closer to the official release!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Outsmart enemies through positioning and timing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Unique Units &amp; Buildings</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use a variety of unit types and structures to shift the tide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Multiplayer &amp; AI</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle online against friends or test your skills against AI opponents.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Tile-Based Expansion</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Claim tiles, build structures, and secure vital resources.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Random World Events</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Adapt your strategy to surprise events like festivals or disasters.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Win by Domination or Survival</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control the most territory or eliminate your rivals.</i></p>",
